L425: Absorption 路径 (decode):
L426: 预计算 W_absorbed = W_q_no_pe @ W_kv_up[:qk_head_dim]
L427: score = q_no_pe @ W_absorbed @ kv_compressed
L428: 等价于: q_content = einsum("sbhd,hdk->sbhk", q_no_pe, up_k_weight)  (L731)
L429: 然后 score = einsum("sbhk,sbk->sbh", q_content, kv_compressed)
